  "comment": "The gun range's guns (docs/design/gun-range.md). Each entry ties a sim gun def (its numbers stay in data/defs) to a model and to how the first-person arms hold it. 'art' is read by the GunArt commandlet (import into /Game/Rim3D/Generated/Guns/<name>/); 'parts' pick the imported meshes by a piece of their name. Points are in the gun's own frame in cm after meshRotation and meshOffset: +X out of the muzzle, +Y right, +Z up, the origin where the firing hand's palm holds the grip. The game reads this file at start and again on F6, so the numbers can be tuned without a rebuild.",
